  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QAUei6a_d.webp?maxwidth=760&fidelity=grand\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"477\"></strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>All the Mods</strong>&nbsp;最初只是為我幾位朋友製作的私人整合包，後來卻演變成了大家都能遊玩的產品！&nbsp;它包含了大多數知名整合包的基礎內容，同時也巧妙搭配了一些較新或較少人知的模組。<br><br>這次最大的變動是我們現已改用 <strong>NeoForge</strong>，並基於 <strong>1.21</strong> 版本。隨著模組陸續上架，後續將會有許多更新！&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>In&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 10</strong>&nbsp;我們將延續一貫傳統，在加入大量新模組的同時，更注重整體的穩定性。</p>\n<p><strong>「All the Mods」真的包含</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>&nbsp;模組嗎？不，當然不是。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nrj9TOe.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"155\"><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hALnQl07S7E?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></a></p>\n<p><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ftNxcMu0fE0?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FvbkI2Zk6Uo?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span><br><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><br>&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XA8ZiUZpJyo\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><br><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/J3J7CLX42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"161\" height=\"41\"></a></p>",
